<Placemark>
	<name>空中加油机上的蓝色鬼魂</name>
	<description><![CDATA[KC-135R refuels a C-5
My First unmarked In-flight spotting! A KC-135R StratoTanker refuels a C-5 Galaxy over Northern California. I found this while looking for landmarks I visited Recently. Can't believe no one marked it before! Very Cool clear shot with ghosts!<br>
http://bbs.keyhole.com/ubb/showthreaded.php/Cat/0/Number/476176<br>
Helomech]]></description>
